<title>GERMANY: RTL leads German Oct TV ratings in key ad groups.</title>
<headline>RTL leads German Oct TV ratings in key ad groups.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The IPA Plus agency released the following data on German television viewer ratings for October:</p>
<p>(Figures in pct):</p>
<p>  VIEWING TIME:		 AGE GROUP:</p>
<p> 5 pm to 11 pm		    14-49</p>
<p> Broadcaster	 Adults	Men    Women   Family with child</p>
<p> RTL		   19.5	 17.7    21.1     22.2</p>
<p> SAT1		  13.3	 13.7    13.0     13.2</p>
<p> ARD		   11.5	 11.0    12.0	9.7</p>
<p> ZDF		    9.8	  9.7     9.9	8.3</p>
<p> PRO7		  15.6	 15.6    15.6     17.4</p>
<p> RTL2		   5.7	  5.7     5.7	5.9</p>
<p> VOX		    3.8	  3.9     3.8	3.8</p>
<p> Kabel1		 3.5	  3.7     3.4	3.3</p>
<p> Super RTL	    2.0	  2.0     2.0	3.3</p>
<p>VIEWING TIME: 8 pm to 11 pm  Broadcaster	 Adults     Men    Women   Family with child</p>
<p> RTL		   19.7	 18.6   20.7    22.1</p>
<p> SAT1		  13.3	 12.9   13.6    13.7</p>
<p> ARD		   10.4	 10.4   10.4     9.2</p>
<p> ZDF		    9.4	  9.2    9.6     8.2</p>
<p> PRO7		  17.1	 17.0   17.3    18.5</p>
<p> RTL2		   6.4	  6.4    6.4     6.5</p>
<p> VOX		    4.2	  4.1    4.3     4.3</p>
<p> Kabel1		 3.4	  3.6    3.2     3.2</p>
<p> Super RTL	    1.3	  1.3    1.4     1.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Sources for data: GfK Fernsehforschung, INMARKT, IPA plus/IP Multimedia Research.</p>
<p>-- William Boston, Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 2609750</p>
